{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "MRRC 产物清单：每个携带版本号的文件在此登记一条规则。新文件开始携带版本/大小时必须补一条规则 —— 这是它不静默漂移的唯一保证。由 dev_tools/release_check.py 消费，tests/test_release_artifacts.py 在套件里执行。pattern 必须锚定到具体位置，绝不可裸扫 V[0-9.]+。",
  "app_version_source": {
    "path": "packaging/windows/MRRC.iss",
    "pattern": "#define MyAppVersion \"([0-9.]+)\"",
    "comment": "安装版本的唯一权威：packaging/windows/build.ps1 与 dev_tools/release_windows.sh 都读它。权威只读不判，不出现在 rules 里（避免循环权威）。"
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "changelog-top",
      "path": "CHANGELOG.md",
      "pattern": "^## \\[(?:V)?([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)\\]",
      "first_only": true,
      "why": "人先改的地方；与 iss 不一致 = 有一条忘了改。顶部夹有 [Unreleased]/[未发布] 等非版本标题，故取首个匹配而非数条数（历史标题有 75 条）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-css",
      "path": "www/mobile_modern.html",
      "pattern": "mobile_modern\\.css\\?v=([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "静态资源缓存戳；不改则手机端拿到旧 JS。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-footer",
      "path": "www/mobile_modern.html",
      "pattern": "version-text\">MRRC V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-zh-footer",
      "path": "www/mobile_modern_zh.html",
      "pattern": "version-text\">MRRC V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-title",
      "path": "README.md",
      "pattern": "\\(MRRC\\) V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-badge",
      "path": "README.md",
      "pattern": "version-V([0-9.]+)-green\\.svg",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-latest",
      "path": "README.md",
      "pattern": "Latest Release: V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "用户可见的\"当前版本\"声明。它曾停在 V6.0.0（落后 11 个版本）而检查器报全绿——因为只有 README_CN/README_en 的对应行受了治理。tests/test_release_artifacts.py::test_every_readme_version_declaration_is_governed 现在同时守着三份 README。"
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-cn-title",
      "path": "README_CN.md",
      "pattern": "\\(MRRC\\) V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-cn-badge",
      "path": "README_CN.md",
      "pattern": "版本-V([0-9.]+)-green\\.svg",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-cn-latest",
      "path": "README_CN.md",
      "pattern": "最新版本: V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "用户可见的\"当前版本\"声明，比 badge 更容易被当真。"
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-en-title",
      "path": "README_en.md",
      "pattern": "\\(MRRC\\) V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-en-badge",
      "path": "README_en.md",
      "pattern": "version-V([0-9.]+)-green\\.svg",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "readme-en-latest",
      "path": "README_en.md",
      "pattern": "Latest Version: V([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "website-stat",
      "path": "website/index.html",
      "pattern": "stat-value\">V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "锚定到 HTML 属性；同一文件里还有 V6.1.0/V6.0.10 的历史举例，裸扫会误报。"
    },
    {
      "id": "website-headline",
      "path": "website/index.html",
      "pattern": "section-title\">V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "website-zh-stat",
      "path": "website/zh/index.html",
      "pattern": "stat-value\">V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "website-zh-headline",
      "path": "website/zh/index.html",
      "pattern": "section-title\">V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mobile-zh-css",
      "path": "www/mobile_modern_zh.html",
      "pattern": "mobile_modern\\.css\\?v=([0-9.]+)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "中文手机页的静态资源缓存戳。原表只登记了英文版（mobile-css），这一条从来没人管，实测停在 5.8.3 —— 落后 11 个版本，中文手机端因此一直拿旧 CSS。"
    },
    {
      "id": "index-hero-en",
      "path": "website/index.html",
      "pattern": ">V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+) · Production Ready<",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "英文主页 hero 徽章。锚定 '· Production Ready' 以免命中页内其它版本字样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "index-hero-zh",
      "path": "website/zh/index.html",
      "pattern": ">V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+) · 生产就绪<",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "中文主页 hero 徽章。"
    },
    {
      "id": "index-footer-en",
      "path": "website/index.html",
      "pattern": "^\\s*V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+) · GPLv3 License",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "英文主页页脚的当前版本声明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "index-footer-zh",
      "path": "website/zh/index.html",
      "pattern": "^\\s*V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+) · GPLv3 协议",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "中文主页页脚的当前版本声明。"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdd-note-zh",
      "path": "website/docs/design/MRRC_SDD.html",
      "pattern": "，当前版本 V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)）",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "SDD 页眉的'当前版本'注记。锚定中文逗号与全角右括号：同文件另有两处**历史**版本字样（'AI 分诊…（V6.1.18 起）'、'核心功能已在V6.1.18实现'）绝不能被规则或替换碰到。"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs-current-api",
      "path": "website/docs/design/API.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "文档页眉统一的'当前版本'注记（正文里 V5.x 是历史版本，故必须锚定这个 strong 结构）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs-current-spec",
      "path": "website/docs/design/SPEC.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs-current-design",
      "path": "website/docs/design.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs-current-features",
      "path": "website/docs/features.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上。注意本文件另有一处历史事实（'validated end-to-end … in V6.1.18'）不在规则内。"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs-current-agentic",
      "path": "website/agentic.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-docs-current-design",
      "path": "website/zh/docs/design.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上（中文站）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-docs-current-features",
      "path": "website/zh/docs/features.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上（中文站）。本文件另有一处历史事实（'V6.1.18 真机端到端验证通过'）不在规则内。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-docs-current-docs",
      "path": "website/zh/docs/docs.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上（中文站）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "zh-docs-current-agentic",
      "path": "website/zh/agentic.html",
      "pattern": "当前版本 <strong>V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)</strong>",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上（中文站）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "arch-title-en",
      "path": "website/docs/design/architecture.html",
      "pattern": "<title>MRRC V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+) Architecture",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "架构图页的 <title>；浏览器标签与搜索结果里可见。"
    },
    {
      "id": "arch-diagram-en",
      "path": "website/docs/design/architecture.html",
      "pattern": "diagram-title\">MRRC V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+) Architecture",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同页图内标题，与 <title> 必须一致。"
    },
    {
      "id": "docs-svg-arch",
      "path": "website/docs/docs.html",
      "pattern": "MRRC System Architecture V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "内嵌 SVG 里的架构图标题 —— 藏在 <text> 节点里，肉眼扫版本号时最容易漏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "install-win-en",
      "path": "website/docs/installation.html",
      "pattern": "Windows Installer \\(V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+), Easiest Path\\)",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "安装指南里'当前安装包版本'的小标题。同页另有两处**历史**门槛（'rigctld now starts automatically (V6.1.18)'、'Already installed (V6.1.18 or newer)?'）是能力引入版本，不在规则内、也不该被替换。"
    },
    {
      "id": "install-win-zh",
      "path": "website/zh/docs/installation.html",
      "pattern": "Windows 安装包（V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)，最简单路径）",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "同上（中文站）。同页两处历史门槛（'V6.1.18 起'、'V6.1.18 及以后'）不在规则内。"
    },
    {
      "id": "winfix-current-zh",
      "path": "website/zh/docs/windows-fix.html",
      "pattern": "新版安装包（当前 V([0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)）",
      "count": 1,
      "why": "修复工具页里'装新版就不用跑修复工具'的当前版本声明。"
    }
  ]
}
